          "body": "6.1 Length, mass and capacity\nUseful conversions: 1 km = 1,000 m; 1 m = 100 cm; 1 kg = 1,000 g; 1 L = 1,000 mL.\n\n6.2 Perimeter and area\nFor a rectangle, perimeter P = 2(l + w) and area A = l × w. A 12 m by 7 m rectangle has perimeter 38 m\nand area 84 m²."
